{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-system-architecture","title":"电商系统架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/ecommerce-system-architecture","wordCount":1924,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"电商系统架构设计\">电商系统架构设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电商系统架构是承载商品展示、交易处理、物流履约和用户服务的技术基座。一个成熟的电商平台需要在高并发访问、海量数据存储、复杂业务流程和极致用户体验之间找到平衡。架构设计的核心挑战在于：如何将业务复杂度映射为技术分层，使每一层职责清晰、独立演进，同时保证跨层协作的高效性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 接入层&#10;        CDN[CDN 加速]&#10;        GW[API 网关]&#10;        LB[负载均衡]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 业务层&#10;        CAT[商品中心]&#10;        ORD[订单中心]&#10;        PAY[支付中心]&#10;        INV[库存中心]&#10;        USR[用户中心]&#10;        MKT[营销中心]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 中间件层&#10;        MQ[消息队列]&#10;        CACHE[分布式缓存]&#10;        SEARCH[搜索引擎]&#10;        CONFIG[配置中心]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 数据层&#10;        DB[(关系数据库)]&#10;        NOSQL[(NoSQL)]&#10;        DW[(数据仓库)]&#10;        OSS[(对象存储)]&#10;    end&#10;    CDN --&gt; GW&#10;    GW --&gt; LB&#10;    LB --&gt; CAT&#10;    LB --&gt; ORD&#10;    LB --&gt; PAY&#10;    LB --&gt; INV&#10;    LB --&gt; USR&#10;    LB --&gt; MKT&#10;    CAT --&gt; MQ&#10;    ORD --&gt; MQ&#10;    CAT --&gt; CACHE&#10;    ORD --&gt; CACHE&#10;    MQ --&gt; DB&#10;    CACHE --&gt; DB&#10;    SEARCH --&gt; NOSQL&#10;    DB --&gt; DW&#10;    CAT --&gt; OSS\">graph TB\n    subgraph 接入层\n        CDN[CDN 加速]\n        GW[API 网关]\n        LB[负载均衡]\n    end\n    subgraph 业务层\n        CAT[商品中心]\n        ORD[订单中心]\n        PAY[支付中心]\n        INV[库存中心]\n        USR[用户中心]\n        MKT[营销中心]\n    end\n    subgraph 中间件层\n        MQ[消息队列]\n        CACHE[分布式缓存]\n        SEARCH[搜索引擎]\n        CONFIG[配置中心]\n    end\n    subgraph 数据层\n        DB[(关系数据库)]\n        NOSQL[(NoSQL)]\n        DW[(数据仓库)]\n        OSS[(对象存储)]\n    end\n    CDN --&gt; GW\n    GW --&gt; LB\n    LB --&gt; CAT\n    LB --&gt; ORD\n    LB --&gt; PAY\n    LB --&gt; INV\n    LB --&gt; USR\n    LB --&gt; MKT\n    CAT --&gt; MQ\n    ORD --&gt; MQ\n    CAT --&gt; CACHE\n    ORD --&gt; CACHE\n    MQ --&gt; DB\n    CACHE --&gt; DB\n    SEARCH --&gt; NOSQL\n    DB --&gt; DW\n    CAT --&gt; OSS</pre><p>电商系统通常采用分层架构，从上到下依次为接入层、业务层、中间件层和数据层，每一层承担不同的技术职责。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构层</th>\n<th>核心职责</th>\n<th>关键组件</th>\n<th>设计要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>接入层</td>\n<td>流量分发与安全防护</td>\n<td>CDN、API 网关、WAF</td>\n<td>限流、鉴权、协议转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务层</td>\n<td>核心业务逻辑处理</td>\n<td>商品、订单、支付、库存服务</td>\n<td>领域拆分、服务治理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间件层</td>\n<td>跨服务通信与数据加速</td>\n<td>消息队列、缓存、搜索引擎</td>\n<td>异步解耦、读写分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据层</td>\n<td>持久化存储与分析</td>\n<td>MySQL、Redis、ES、HDFS</td>\n<td>分库分表、主从复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"业务领域建模与模块划分\">业务领域建模与模块划分</h2><p>电商平台的核心领域可以拆分为六大业务模块，每个模块管理自己的数据模型和业务规则。这种划分遵循领域驱动设计（DDD）的思想，以业务边界而非技术边界来组织代码。</p>\n<p><strong>商品中心</strong>负责 SPU（标准产品单元）和 SKU（库存量单位）的管理。一个 SPU 对应一款商品，一个 SKU 对应具体的规格组合（颜色、尺寸等）。商品中心还管理类目树、属性体系、品牌信息和商品详情页的富文本内容。类目树通常采用多级分类（一般三到四级），配合属性模板实现结构化商品描述。</p>\n<p><strong>订单中心</strong>是电商系统的核心枢纽，连接用户、商品、支付和物流。订单生命周期从用户下单开始，经过待支付、已支付、待发货、已发货、已收货、已完成等状态流转。每个状态转换都伴随着具体的业务动作：支付回调触发扣减库存、发货触发物流追踪、确认收货触发结算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Order {&#10;  orderId: string;&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  items: OrderItem[];&#10;  status: OrderStatus;&#10;  totalAmount: number;&#10;  paymentInfo: PaymentInfo;&#10;  shippingInfo: ShippingInfo;&#10;  createdAt: Date;&#10;  updatedAt: Date;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type OrderStatus =&#10;  | &#39;pending_payment&#39;&#10;  | &#39;paid&#39;&#10;  | &#39;pending_shipment&#39;&#10;  | &#39;shipped&#39;&#10;  | &#39;delivered&#39;&#10;  | &#39;completed&#39;&#10;  | &#39;cancelled&#39;&#10;  | &#39;refunding&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface OrderItem {&#10;  skuId: string;&#10;  productName: string;&#10;  quantity: number;&#10;  unitPrice: number;&#10;  discount: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  shippingInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShippingInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  updatedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending_payment'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending_shipment'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shipped'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivered'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cancelled'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refunding'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  skuId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  productName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  unitPrice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  discount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>支付中心</strong>处理多渠道支付接入、支付状态管理和资金对账。<strong>库存中心</strong>实现预扣、确认和释放三阶段库存管理，防止超卖。<strong>用户中心</strong>管理账号体系、地址簿和会员等级。<strong>营销中心</strong>负责优惠券、满减、秒杀等促销活动的规则引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订单状态机与事件驱动\">订单状态机与事件驱动</h2><p>订单状态机是电商系统中最复杂的业务模型之一。状态机定义了订单在不同状态之间的合法转换路径，每次转换都必须满足前置条件并触发相应的副作用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; 待支付: 用户下单&#10;    待支付 --&gt; 已支付: 支付成功&#10;    待支付 --&gt; 已取消: 超时/手动取消&#10;    已支付 --&gt; 待发货: 商家确认&#10;    已支付 --&gt; 退款中: 用户申请退款&#10;    待发货 --&gt; 已发货: 商家发货&#10;    待发货 --&gt; 退款中: 用户申请退款&#10;    已发货 --&gt; 已收货: 用户确认/自动确认&#10;    已收货 --&gt; 已完成: 售后期结束&#10;    已收货 --&gt; 退款中: 用户申请售后&#10;    退款中 --&gt; 已退款: 退款完成&#10;    已完成 --&gt; [*]&#10;    已取消 --&gt; [*]&#10;    已退款 --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; 待支付: 用户下单\n    待支付 --&gt; 已支付: 支付成功\n    待支付 --&gt; 已取消: 超时/手动取消\n    已支付 --&gt; 待发货: 商家确认\n    已支付 --&gt; 退款中: 用户申请退款\n    待发货 --&gt; 已发货: 商家发货\n    待发货 --&gt; 退款中: 用户申请退款\n    已发货 --&gt; 已收货: 用户确认/自动确认\n    已收货 --&gt; 已完成: 售后期结束\n    已收货 --&gt; 退款中: 用户申请售后\n    退款中 --&gt; 已退款: 退款完成\n    已完成 --&gt; [*]\n    已取消 --&gt; [*]\n    已退款 --&gt; [*]</pre><p>事件驱动架构将订单状态变更解耦为事件的发布与消费。当订单支付成功时，支付中心发布 <code>OrderPaid</code> 事件，库存中心消费该事件执行实际扣减，物流中心消费该事件创建待发货任务，营销中心消费该事件更新用户积分。这种模式避免了服务间的同步调用依赖，提高了系统的可靠性和可扩展性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DomainEvent {&#10;  eventId: string;&#10;  eventType: string;&#10;  aggregateId: string;&#10;  payload: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  timestamp: Date;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ORDER_EVENTS = {&#10;  ORDER_CREATED: &#39;order.created&#39;,&#10;  ORDER_PAID: &#39;order.paid&#39;,&#10;  ORDER_SHIPPED: &#39;order.shipped&#39;,&#10;  ORDER_DELIVERED: &#39;order.delivered&#39;,&#10;  ORDER_CANCELLED: &#39;order.cancelled&#39;,&#10;  ORDER_REFUND_REQUESTED: &#39;order.refund.requested&#39;,&#10;} as const;&#10;&#10;function publishEvent(event: DomainEvent): void {&#10;  messageQueue.publish(event.eventType, JSON.stringify(event));&#10;}&#10;&#10;function handleOrderPaid(event: DomainEvent): void {&#10;  inventoryService.confirmDeduction(event.aggregateId);&#10;  logisticsService.createShipmentTask(event.aggregateId);&#10;  pointsService.addPoints(event.payload.userId as string, event.payload.amount as number);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  aggregateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ORDER_EVENTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ORDER_CREATED: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ORDER_PAID: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ORDER_SHIPPED: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ORDER_DELIVERED: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ORDER_CANCELLED: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ORDER_REFUND_REQUESTED: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.refund.requested'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> publishEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messageQueue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.eventType, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleOrderPaid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inventoryService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">confirmDeduction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.aggregateId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logisticsService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createShipmentTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.aggregateId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pointsService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addPoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.payload.userId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.payload.amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>事件的可靠投递通过「本地事件表 + 定时轮询」模式保证：业务操作和事件写入在同一个本地事务中完成，定时任务扫描未发送的事件并推送到消息队列，消费端通过幂等设计保证重复消费的安全性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分库分表与数据分片策略\">分库分表与数据分片策略</h2><p>当单库数据量突破千万级别、单表行数超过五千万时，电商系统需要引入分库分表策略来保持查询性能。分片策略的选择直接影响数据的均匀分布和跨片查询的复杂度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片维度</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户 ID</td>\n<td>Hash 取模</td>\n<td>数据均匀</td>\n<td>跨用户查询需聚合</td>\n<td>订单表、购物车表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品 ID</td>\n<td>Range 分区</td>\n<td>范围查询友好</td>\n<td>热点数据可能集中</td>\n<td>商品表、评价表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>按月/按季度分表</td>\n<td>历史归档方便</td>\n<td>跨时间段查询复杂</td>\n<td>日志表、流水表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租户 ID</td>\n<td>独立库</td>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>资源利用率低</td>\n<td>SaaS 多租户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合键</td>\n<td>(userId, orderId) 联合</td>\n<td>兼顾多维查询</td>\n<td>路由逻辑复杂</td>\n<td>高并发混合查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>订单表通常按用户 ID 进行 Hash 分片，保证同一用户的所有订单在同一个物理分片上，避免下单和查询订单时的跨片操作。商品表可以按商品 ID 进行 Range 分片或 Hash 分片，取决于业务查询模式。交易流水表按时间维度分表，历史数据定期归档到数据仓库。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function getShardIndex(userId: string, totalShards: number): number {&#10;  const hash = murmurhash3(userId);&#10;  return hash % totalShards;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function getOrderTableName(userId: string): string {&#10;  const shardIndex = getShardIndex(userId, 64);&#10;  return `order_${String(shardIndex).padStart(3, &#39;0&#39;)}`;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function routeDataSource(userId: string): string {&#10;  const dbIndex = getShardIndex(userId, 8);&#10;  return `ds_order_${dbIndex}`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getShardIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">totalShards</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> murmurhash3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalShards;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getOrderTableName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> shardIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getShardIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `order_${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shardIndex</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> routeDataSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dbIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getShardIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `ds_order_${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dbIndex</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分布式 ID 生成是分库分表的前置条件。常见方案包括 Snowflake 算法（时间戳 + 机器 ID + 序列号）、Leaf 号段模式（数据库号段预分配）和 UUID。Snowflake 算法在分布式环境下能保证全局唯一且趋势递增，是电商系统的主流选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存架构与性能优化\">缓存架构与性能优化</h2><p>电商系统对缓存的依赖极深。商品详情页每秒数万次访问，如果每次都查询数据库，系统将迅速崩溃。合理的缓存架构采用多级缓存策略：浏览器缓存 → CDN 缓存 → 应用层本地缓存 → 分布式缓存 → 数据库。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    REQ[用户请求] --&gt; L1[浏览器缓存]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|miss| L2[CDN 缓存]&#10;    L2 --&gt;|miss| L3[本地缓存 Caffeine]&#10;    L3 --&gt;|miss| L4[Redis 集群]&#10;    L4 --&gt;|miss| DB[(MySQL)]&#10;    DB --&gt;|回填| L4&#10;    L4 --&gt;|回填| L3\">graph LR\n    REQ[用户请求] --&gt; L1[浏览器缓存]\n    L1 --&gt;|miss| L2[CDN 缓存]\n    L2 --&gt;|miss| L3[本地缓存 Caffeine]\n    L3 --&gt;|miss| L4[Redis 集群]\n    L4 --&gt;|miss| DB[(MySQL)]\n    DB --&gt;|回填| L4\n    L4 --&gt;|回填| L3</pre><p>缓存一致性是电商场景的核心难题。商品价格变更、库存扣减等操作必须及时反映到缓存中。常用的一致性策略有三种：Cache-Aside（旁路缓存，读时回填、写时删除）、Write-Through（写穿透，写入同时更新缓存和数据库）、Write-Behind（写回，异步批量更新数据库）。电商系统多采用 Cache-Aside 配合消息驱动的缓存失效机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function getProduct(productId: string): Promise&lt;Product&gt; {&#10;  const cacheKey = `product:${productId}`;&#10;  const cached = await localCache.get&lt;Product&gt;(cacheKey);&#10;  if (cached) return cached;&#10;&#10;  const redisCached = await redis.get(cacheKey);&#10;  if (redisCached) {&#10;    const product = JSON.parse(redisCached) as Product;&#10;    localCache.set(cacheKey, product, { ttl: 60 });&#10;    return product;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const product = await db.query&lt;Product&gt;(&#39;SELECT * FROM products WHERE id = ?&#39;, [productId]);&#10;  await redis.setex(cacheKey, 3600, JSON.stringify(product));&#10;  localCache.set(cacheKey, product, { ttl: 60 });&#10;  return product;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function invalidateProductCache(productId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const cacheKey = `product:${productId}`;&#10;  await redis.del(cacheKey);&#10;  localCache.delete(cacheKey);&#10;  await messageBus.publish(&#39;cache.invalidate&#39;, { key: cacheKey });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cacheKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `product:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cached</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> localCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(cacheKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cached) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cached;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> redisCached</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cacheKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (redisCached) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(redisCached) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    localCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cacheKey, product, { ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM products WHERE id = ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [productId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cacheKey, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  localCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cacheKey, product, { ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> invalidateProductCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cacheKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `product:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">productId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">del</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cacheKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  localCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cacheKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> messageBus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cache.invalidate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { key: cacheKey });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>热点数据的缓存击穿、缓存雪崩和缓存穿透是三个典型问题。缓存击穿通过互斥锁或逻辑过期解决；缓存雪崩通过 TTL 随机化和多级缓存缓解；缓存穿透通过布隆过滤器或空值缓存防御。大促场景下还需要缓存预热——提前将热门商品数据加载到缓存中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电商系统采用四层分层架构：接入层负责流量分发和安全防护，业务层实现核心业务逻辑，中间件层提供异步通信和数据加速，数据层保证持久化和分析能力</li>\n<li>业务领域按 DDD 思想划分为商品、订单、支付、库存、用户、营销六大模块，每个模块拥有独立的数据模型和业务规则</li>\n<li>订单状态机定义了严格的状态转换路径，事件驱动架构将状态变更解耦为事件发布与消费，通过本地事件表保证可靠投递</li>\n<li>分库分表策略根据业务查询模式选择分片维度，订单表按用户 ID Hash 分片，流水表按时间分表，配合 Snowflake 算法生成分布式 ID</li>\n<li>多级缓存架构从浏览器到数据库层层拦截请求，Cache-Aside 策略配合消息驱动的缓存失效机制解决一致性问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电商系统架构设计","id":"电商系统架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"业务领域建模与模块划分","id":"业务领域建模与模块划分"},{"level":2,"text":"订单状态机与事件驱动","id":"订单状态机与事件驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"分库分表与数据分片策略","id":"分库分表与数据分片策略"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存架构与性能优化","id":"缓存架构与性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"微服务架构在电商中的实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/microservices-for-ecommerce"}}